                    "description": "An array of billing schedules, which allow you to bill customers in advance for multiple service periods. Requires flexible billing mode and API version 2026-05-27.dahlia or later. Learn more about [prebilling](https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prebilling).",
